 👉sued CA election officials, seeking a halt to counting 20,000 mail-in ballots it says are from "likely" noncitizens;
👉 asked a court to preemptively block Alaska’s Senate results if the GOPer candidate doesn't win;
👉 claims it has found 250,000 noncitizens registered to vote in Pennsylvania, California, New Jersey, and Nevada.

The mad king's modus operandi seems to be the ol' "heads I win, tails you lose." 
Rejecting election results and voter suppression are among the many signs of fascism from this corrupt regime. 

