His staff member would not let us inside and twice shooed us from the steps because we were blocking the way. Even though we were the only ones asking to enter. 

@indivisiblelancastertogether  organized this local event, and others are happening around the country today. Other sponsors are Peace, Justice, Sustainability NOW, an Associate of National Peace Action; Lancaster Peace Action Network; NIAC--National Iranian American Council; and @thirdact / @thirdActPA', 'datetime': '2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z', 'id': '4012167667239364249', 'image_url': 'https://scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/857779468_17907098421576349_74137489208859533_n.webp?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=stfGsysWqcAQ7kNvwGIfxAk&_nc_oc=AdoyxT8GmdZOMHVVA1IsMS2e2JIy2tXlVeVI0HHo7q5Un78hiRcBoAXkFu0M02wM_aA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=tx0EctHD1sMnH6uYeQXLAA&_nc_ss=7a689&oh=00_AQTU3Fv4GyT2WfHdp7VvaqtuwwPP8Nhh4TCMMaCTbQl9Kg&oe=6AED6BA3', 'post_hashtags': None, 'content_type': 'Carousel', 'url': 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DeuFTxpHCaZ'}, {'caption': "The mad king blames Russia's invasion of Ukraine on Ukraine. He blames the rising cost of diesel on Ukraine, even though the cause is his ill-conceived war on Iran. 
This week, the mad king and the richest man in the world blamed each other for throttling the speed of satellite internet in Ukraine. That left Ukraine civilians without warnings of attacks and interrupted drone strikes on Russia. 
The mad king also waived sanctions against Russia that Congress had just passed. 

The mad king is ignoring Congress. He is also embracing an authoritarian/fascist country while betraying our allies. We pointed out these and other signs of fascism this week.

Thank you to our marshals from @indivisiblelancastertogether 

To join our weekly vigils, email boldactionworks@gmail.com 

