The mad king is doing whatever he can to suppress the vote and make it appear fraudulent. His regime has sued California in an attempt to block 20,000 mail-in ballots. It raided the home of Ilhan Omar, a sitting representative who is up for re-election, in hopes of deporting her. At his rallies and on social media, the mad king casts doubt on how ballots are counted and who is voting. His ally, Elon  Musk, the richest man in the world, has dumped $276 million into GOP campaigns, including more than $150 million into a single Senate race, in Texas. (He recently settled a lawsuit over his $1-million-a-day lottery to registered voters in swing states in the 2024 election.) 

Suppressing the vote and manipulating elections are signs of fascism. 

Thank you to our wonderful marshals from @indivisiblelancastertogether 💙🗳

