At a rally, he claimed that "when the blues come in, everything becomes dirty.... Everything becomes dirty and has a bad smell."

He has called Senate candidate Abdul El-Sayed a "Radical Jihadist."

Today, his Homeland Security goons searched the home of U.S. Rep. Ilhan Omar, whom he has called "garbage."

We'll keep pointing out these signs of fascism at our weekly silent vigils. 
